  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📜 說明</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>此模組新增了來自 Apotheosis 的飛行藥水。</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>原始模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis</a></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📝 聯絡資訊</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>我的 Discord：Donne431#6562 / donne431</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/NQBhQRDEhF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/NQBhQRDEhF</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>贊助 ☕ - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.donationalerts.com%252fr%252fdonne431\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.donationalerts.com/r/donne431</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⁉️ 常見問題</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以在我的整合包中使用此模組嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：當然可以！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：我能如何支持你？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：您可以簡單地留言、加入 Discord 伺服器，或向我贊助（Discord 與贊助連結請參閱上方的「聯絡資訊」區塊）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>‼️ 警告</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>若您已將此模組發布於其他網站，請務必附上 <em>CurseForge</em> 或 <em>Modrinth</em> 的原始連結，感謝您的配合。</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><br><br>RU 🇷🇺 <br><br><br><br>&lt;button class=\"listenButton\" title=\"播放\"&gt;&lt;/button&gt; <br><br><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n&lt;button class=&quot;listenButton&quot; title=&quot;播放&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
